      "id": "implementation/case-version-release-gate/refuse-a-release-manifesting-a-draft-revision",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/case-version-release-gate/refuse-a-release-manifesting-a-draft-revision.md",
      "title": "Refuse a case version's release over a draft revision",
      "summary": "ReleaseOperation's existing violation aggregation now also checks every manifest entry's referenced hypothesis-revision own state through IHypothesisRevisionOwnStateQuery, naming every draft-state one among CaseVersionNotReleasableError's violations.",
      "task": "task/case-version-release-gate/refuse-a-release-manifesting-a-draft-revision"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/fixture-revision-own-state/release-fixture-manifested-revisions",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/fixture-revision-own-state/release-fixture-manifested-revisions.md",
      "title": "Give the canonical fixture and seed setup's manifested revisions their own released state",
      "summary": "The shared fixture builder, the production seed script, and the ad-hoc case built by manifest-collects-survive-release.spec.ts now directly write each manifest-referenced hypothesis-revision's own state to released right after the case version that manifests it is released, restoring the protection migration 0021 moved onto that column.",
      "task": "task/fixture-revision-own-state/release-fixture-manifested-revisions"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-release/expose-the-release-hypothesis-endpoint",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-release/expose-the-release-hypothesis-endpoint.md",
      "title": "Expose release-hypothesis on the published case-lifecycle HTTP surface",
      "summary": "A new POST route, wired end to end through build-app.ts and its own factory, dispatches ReleaseHypothesisRevisionOperation against a hypothesis-revision named by slug, hypothesis name and revision alone, with no case-version or body payload involved.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-release/expose-the-release-hypothesis-endpoint"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-release/release-a-revision-directly",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-release/release-a-revision-directly.md",
      "title": "Release a hypothesis-revision directly against its own state",
      "summary": "A new domain operation moves a hypothesis-revision from draft to released by its own identity alone, refusing with HypothesisRevisionNotDraftAtReleaseError — an error carrying no context at all — when the revision is not currently draft.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-release/release-a-revision-directly"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/overwrite-only-while-the-revision-is-draft",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/overwrite-only-while-the-revision-is-draft.md",
      "title": "Revise decides overwrite-vs-create from a hypothesis-revision's own state column",
      "summary": "ReviseHypothesisOperation's overwrite/insert branch and the port/repository seam it reads now decide from hypothesis_revisions.state directly, replacing the manifest-join reading.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-state/overwrite-only-while-the-revision-is-draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/refuse-altering-a-released-revision",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/refuse-altering-a-released-revision.md",
      "title": "Refuse a released hypothesis-revision's alteration from its own state",
      "summary": "A migration that moves the schema's release-conditioned refusal on hypothesis_revisions and hypothesis_revision_collects off the case-version join and onto the revision's own state column.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-state/refuse-altering-a-released-revision"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state.md",
      "title": "Store the hypothesis-revision's own state column and write draft on insert",
      "summary": "Adds hypothesis_revisions.state (draft/released, NOT NULL, CHECK-constrained) via a new numbered migration, and makes the insert write path name it explicitly as draft, leaving the overwrite path untouched.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state"
    },
    {
