      "title": "Retire the manifest-basis assertions from the two obsolete persistence schema specs",
      "summary": "Removed the two obsolete assertions (rejection and content-survival in revision-alteration-refused-only-when-released-schema.spec.ts, and collects-survival in protect-released-hypothesis-revision-collects-schema.spec.ts) that attributed the release trigger's refusal to a released case version's manifest reference, since migration 0021 already moved the condition onto hypothesis_revisions.state alone and the equivalent state-only assertions already stand in refuse-altering-a-released-revision-schema.spec.ts.",
      "task": "task/obsolete-protection-basis-tests/retire-manifest-basis-schema-specs"
    },
